  "version": "0.6.1-beta.5",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.6.1-beta.4`\n\n### Features\n\n- let the badge a tab shows for an AI agent take a chosen style and color: seven animations while it works (half disc, ring, comet, orbit, pulse, dots, braille) and three marks while it waits (pause bars, ring, still pause bars), each in the theme's color or one picked in Settings > Appearance, shown running beside its name; every style animates only transform and opacity so the badges stay on the compositor, and settings sync carries the choice ([0a3e36b9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/0a3e36b9e3d6bc20604a5299a06b926d90bf2386))\n- let notifications play a chosen sound instead of the system's: four built-in tones synthesized in the app (chime, ding, pop, rise) or an audio file of up to 1 MB, since the system sound was unpleasant and a Windows toast plays only the system's sounds for an unpackaged app, so the notification is shown silently and tTerm plays the sound itself on every platform, falling back to the system sound when the file cannot be read or decoded; a picked file is copied into the config folder so it outlives the original, and local and WebDAV backups, their restore snapshots and settings sync carry the copy to other devices ([9e17d02d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9e17d02df429f8f1c3cf1781bc9030a42cd222a2))\n\n### UI and usability\n\n- make the ring the default working animation, since the loading spinners now take it and the ring is closest to the arc they showed before, and say under Settings > Appearance that every loading spinner uses the working animation ([d2a08273](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/d2a082735119171bc4d1604e490d2a8d7bbc9cbc))\n- show every loading spinner in the AI agent's working animation: the 44 Loader2 and LoaderCircle icons become Spinner, and the three refresh buttons that spun their icon show a Spinner while loading; a button that holds a Spinner keeps the narrower padding it has for an icon, so it does not widen while busy, and ESLint now refuses lucide's loader icons ([8dc1ccee](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8dc1ccee0d83a99f23dec3fe5f10073c5f6f5f33))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.6.1-beta.4...v0.6.1-beta.5](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.6.1-beta.4...v0.6.1-beta.5)",
